cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RivaPlan: A QGIS Processing plugin for river planform morphology analysis"
message: "If you use RivaPlan, please cite this software repository and the associated journal article when available."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sharma
    given-names: Rohit
version: "2.1.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rohit-Sharma-21/RivaPlan"
url: "https://plugins.qgis.org/plugins/Planform_Morphology/"
abstract: "RivaPlan is an open-source QGIS Processing plugin providing seven tools for river corridor centerline generation, line-direction reversal, river width, bankline and centerline shifting, sinuosity, and local curvature analysis. Version 2.1.1 improves centerline generation with a user-adjustable bank-exclusion buffer and diagnostics."
keywords:
  - QGIS
  - PyQGIS
  - river planform morphology
  - river centerline
  - river width
  - bankline migration
  - centerline migration
  - sinuosity
  - curvature
  - fluvial geomorphology
license: GPL-3.0-only
